# Never copy host-installed dependencies or build output into the image build
# context. The Dockerfile runs `npm install` inside the (Linux) build stage, so
# copying the host's node_modules (macOS/arm64 binaries, possibly a different
# esbuild version) over them causes esbuild's "Host version X does not match
# binary version Y" failure. Let each stage install its own deps.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
.git
*.log
.DS_Store
